  SELECTOR-3's OWN gates both passed: the observer-bootstrap
  mechanism was staked before this instrument existed, holds across
  every macro cycle type at n = 4 and n = 5, and the selected
  fraction falls at every step under a derived law going to zero.
  That is the programme's first rule-6 support for an Ω-internal
